tests: cover the merged series with Wine's own test suite

Union of the two series' tests patches - AutoCAD `0017-tests-cover-the-series.patch` and Power BI
`0007-tests-cover-the-series.patch` - de-duplicated.  One regression test per patch that changes
Wine code, in that module's dlls/<module>/tests/ suite and wired into START_TEST, so that reverting
the patch makes the test fail.

Both series add the same secur32 GetUserNameExW domain test to `dlls/secur32/tests/secur32.c`.
Power BI's section is the strict superset - the identical include, testGetUserNameEx_domain and
START_TEST hunks, plus the `LsaFreeReturnBuffer` return-value check that covers Power BI's `0004`
and shifts the last hunk's offset by one.  The `dlls/secur32/tests/secur32.c` section below is
therefore Power BI's; the AutoCAD copy of it is not repeated.  Every other test module differs
between the two series and is carried verbatim.

Modules from the AutoCAD series: advapi32 (its 0002), crypt32 (0007), dnsapi (0010), kernel32/file
(0008), kernel32/process+thread and ntdll/path (0010), ntdll/pipe (0009), urlmon (0003),
wintrust (0001), ws2_32 (0006, 0012).  Modules from the Power BI series: ntdll/impersonate (0002),
secur32/negotiate and wintypes (0001), oledb32 (0006), plus secur32 above (0004, 0005).

